      "content": "That makes sense, but it's a bit too \"safe\" for the club I'm playing. I need more bite. Like, if I want to do a bit about the \"accent\" trope or the \"nerdy/tech\" stereotype, can you give me a few actual joke setups or premises? I want to see how people usually frame them so I can decide if I want to lean into the caricature for the shock value or pivot away from it. Just give me some examples of how those tropes usually look in a joke.",
